  id: S-01
  lines:
  - speaker: "Sakac\u0131 Nuri"
    text: "Yine dereye mi inece\u011Fiz muhtar\u0131m?"
  - speaker: Muhtar Yusuf
    text: "Dere de kurudu Nuri. C\xE2bir Usta'n\u0131n yeni bir \xE7\u0131ra\u011F\u0131
      varm\u0131\u015F, ona umut ba\u011Flad\u0131m."
  - speaker: "Sakac\u0131 Nuri"
    text: "\xC7\u0131rak dedi\u011Fin ka\xE7 ya\u015F\u0131nda ki?"
  - speaker: Muhtar Yusuf
    text: "Boyuna bakma. Kafas\u0131 i\u015Fliyormu\u015F."
